     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think you&#39;re encountering this issue, where a https resource won&#39;t load properly in the RStudio viewer in Windows.<div>  <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/1148\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/1148&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389104575000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QabpXILeL0fXlamFTVp5o\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues/1148</a><br><div><br></div><div><div>Even though you&#39;re using a http URL, the image from <a href=\"http://wikimedia.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://wikimedia.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389104575000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ce14cDZIx10D43VYPdPjN\">wikimedia.org</a> gets redirected to a https URL.</div></div><div><br></div><div>If you open it in a regular web browser, it will show properly.</div><div><br></div><div>The issue has been filed with the RStudio IDE team.</div><div><br></div><div>-Winston</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Aug 17, 2017 at 12:24 PM, Arthur Steinmetz <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">apste...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I know this has been discussed before but those answers did not solve my problem.  I have forked the code at the  <a href=\"https://github.com/apsteinmetz/shiny-examples/tree/master/052-navbar-example\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/apsteinmetz/shiny-examples/tree/master/052-navbar-example&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389104575000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0NYo3K6N9O5Nf5q_kpCOCb\">github gallery example</a> for nav bars  and it doesn&#39;t render the images on the &quot;About&quot; page.  I just see a little &quot;question mark&quot; square in place of the image. The gallery at <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/navbar-example.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/navbar-example.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389104575000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1afVLSt430NTRaTM_xhvVW\">http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/navbar-example.html</a> works fine so I am assuming the code is valid.<div><br></div><div>So I assume there is something basic I&#39;m missing.  Is there a library that needs to be loaded?  The verbatim ui.r from github is below.  Again, this works at the Shiny gallery but not on my Windows machine.  Thanks for any help.<br><div><br></div><div><table style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"></td><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre-wrap\">library(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">markdown</span>)</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monos